  "description": "A .NET 10 / .NET 8 charting library inspired by matplotlib: fluent API, DI-friendly, server-rendered SVG / PNG / PDF / animated GIF. 83 series types across 14 categories, 148 colormaps, 30 themes, LaTeX-style MathText, O(1) streaming, and a control room (Plt.OpsDashboard() - KPI tiles, state timelines and one shared trend window on a caller-supplied clock). No JavaScript framework, no WebView, no SaaS.",
